### Subscriptions & Read-Only Middleware Demo Requests
### Base URLs
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@tenantUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/tenant
@publicUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/public
@token = your_tenant_token_here

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Tenant Read-Only & Grace Period Demonstration
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Read Request (Always Allowed for Active/Trial/Grace/Expired)
GET {{tenantUrl}}/profile
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Write Request: Create Resource
### - Returns 201 when subscription or trial is active
### - Returns 201 + X-Subscription-Warning header when in Grace Period
### - Returns 403 Forbidden when subscription is expired (Read-Only mode)
POST {{tenantUrl}}/resources
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "New Project Resource",
    "description": "Demonstrating write operation under subscription enforcement"
}
